      "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* 4.x: Try to fix parallel testng failures by @akarnokd in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8067\r\n* chore(deps): bump biz.aQute.bnd.builder from 7.2.1 to 7.2.3 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8073\r\n* chore(deps): bump actions/setup-python from 5.6.0 to 6.2.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8072\r\n* chore(deps): bump actions/cache from 4.2.4 to 5.0.4 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8071\r\n* chore(deps): bump gradle/actions from 205054a7257716ec64af10a2e2ff1ac5d3b132db to 39e147cb9de83bb9910b8ef8bd7fff0ee20fcd6f by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8068\r\n* chore(deps): bump SethCohen/github-releases-to-discord from 1b3dde6c63d699e660bf6e1b5605217b84d700fe to b96a33520f8ad5e6dcdecee6f1212bdf88b16550 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8070\r\n* chore(deps): bump captradeoff/x-post-action from d643d2bb835a1c915a056b2241cbda3c444d016d to 3538d7eeb4e7d50013ed06127f352967967da8c9 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8069\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/compare/v4.0.0-alpha-9...v4.0.0-alpha-10",
