      "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* chore(deps): bump gradle/actions from 5 to 6 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8052\r\n* Harden RxJava CI toolchain by @akarnokd in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8055\r\n* Update gradle_release.yml, limit write capabilities of tools by @akarnokd in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8056\r\n* Fix gradle_snapshot.yml - need to checkout/gradle at push too by @akarnokd in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8059\r\n* gradle_snapshot.yml run build -> prerelease sequentially by @akarnokd in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8062\r\n* Cache things with entropy-beauty-scan.yml by @akarnokd in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8064\r\n* 4.x: Report back test failures in a readable manner for PRs/Snaps by @akarnokd in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8066\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/compare/v4.0.0-alpha-8...v4.0.0-alpha-9",
