      "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/zipball/v4.0.0-alpha-8",
      "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* 4.x: Introduce `Streamable` / `Streamer`, inspired by C#'s `IAsyncEnumerable` / `IAsyncEnumerator` by @akarnokd in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8048\r\n* chore(deps): bump github/codeql-action from 4.33.0 to 4.34.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8049\r\n* 4.x: Improve Javadocs + limit line length + cleanup indentation + check by @akarnokd in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8050\r\n* 4.x: Introduce `Schedulers.virtual()`, `Schedulers.cached()`, deprecate `Schedulers.io()`, fix tests by @akarnokd in https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/pull/8051\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/compare/v4.0.0-alpha-7-2...v4.0.0-alpha-8",
